Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://notepad-plus-plus.org/
Description: native GTK text and source code editor based on Notepad++ components
 Notepad++ Linux is a native Linux editor (no Wine) built with GTK 3 on the
 Scintilla and Lexilla components used by Notepad++.
 .
 It offers tabs, syntax highlighting, search and replace in files and folders,
 macros, crash recovery, function list, document map, project folders,
 user-defined languages in the Notepad++ XML format, configurable styles and
 native Linux plugins. Windows plugin DLLs are not supported.
